<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS8.SSS8" title="In 7.8 Additional Experiments and Discussion ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.8.8 </span>Additional Experiment on Generalization to OOD data through Finetuning</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS8.SSS9" title="In 7.8 Additional Experiments and Discussion ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.8.9 </span>Additional discussion and results on downstream application</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS8.SSS10" title="In 7.8 Additional Experiments and Discussion ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.8.10 </span>Downstream Application2: Multi-Sensory Action Planning</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS8.SSS11" title="In 7.8 Additional Experiments and Discussion ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.8.11 </span>Higher Resolution Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS8.SSS12" title="In 7.8 Additional Experiments and Discussion ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.8.12 </span>Additioanl qualitative results on other dataset</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS9" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.9 </span>Additional Qualitative Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS9.SSS1" title="In 7.9 Additional Qualitative Results ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.9.1 </span>Failure Cases</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
