<li id="bib.bib11" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[11]</span></span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib11.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Yung-Yu Chuang, Dan B Goldman, Ke Colin Zheng, Brian Curless, David H Salesin, and Richard Szeliski.
