<div id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Generalization to out-of-domain OOD data through model finetuning</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(h)</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Additional qualitative results on other dataset</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(i)</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Downsteam application 2: multisensory action planning</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(j)</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i8.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Additional discussion and results on and downstream application</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">9.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Higher Resolution Results</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">10.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Additional Qualitative Results</p>
</div></li>
