<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">7.8.6 </span>Cross Subject Testing</h4>

<div id="S7.SS8.SSS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS8.SSS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the cross subject testing, where we use three other different subjects for testing and training with the rest using the ActionSense dataset, result can be found in Table. <a href="#S7.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ 7.8.6 Cross Subject Testing ‣ 7.8 Additional Experiments and Discussion ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ MultiModal Action Conditioned Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>.</p>
</div>
